@startuml
actor Driver; participant "React UI" as UI; participant "FastAPI" as API; database DB
Driver -> UI: choose green slot, enter plate
UI -> API: POST /api/bookings (JWT)
API -> API: verify token (AuthGuard)
API -> DB: SELECT slot
alt slot vacant
 API -> DB: slot=reserved; INSERT booking
 API --> UI: 200 booking
 UI --> Driver: confirmation
else taken
 API --> UI: 409 slot taken
 UI --> Driver: error, pick another
end
@enduml
